### Backend Files

#### `backend/.env.example`

```env
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=development
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
JWT_EXPIRATION=1d
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=postgres
DB_NAME=mediflow
REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379
KEYCLOAK_URL=http://keycloak:8080
KEYCLOAK_REALM=mediflow
KEYCLOAK_CLIENT=mediflow-client
KEYCLOAK_SECRET=your-secret
FHIR_SERVER_URL=http://fhir-server:8080
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_key
CLAUDE_API_KEY=your_claude_key
```
